d, and why the attempt to stop them backfired\n- [Flamencos contra los Trump: la rebelión ambiental que sacude Albania](https://www.opendemocracy.net/es/revolucion-flamencos-resorts-trump-kushner-albania.md) - El proyecto de lujo de la hija y el yerno de Trump que encendió una crisis política en Albania\n- [Exclusive: Palantir’s massive tax break!](https://www.opendemocracy.net/weekly-email-270626.md) - openDemocracy Weekly Newsletter 27 June 2026\n- [TikTok, Teleperformance y la muerte de una moderadora de contenido](https://www.opendemocracy.net/tik-tok-teleperformance-y-la-muerte-de-una-moderadora-de-contenido.md) - Newsletter correspondiente al 26 de junio de 2026\n- [Vida y muerte de una moderadora de contenido de TikTok](https://www.opendemocracy.net/es/tiktok-teleperformance-explotacion-laboral-moderacion-contenidos-kenia-nigeria-muerte-trabajadores-migraciones-trata-laboral.md) - Promesas falsas, explotación laboral y abuso: la historia de una moderadora de TikTok que murió lejos de casa\n- [Is money laundering the issue that could reshape British politics?](https://www.opendemocracy.net/andy-burnham-must-focus-money-laundering-general-election-2029-reform-uk-labour.md) - Andy Burnham would be wise to turn attention to how the economy is being cheated of billions of pounds a year\n- [Flamingos, Jared Kushner, and Albania’s fight against Trump’s Resorts](https://www.opendemocracy.net/flamingos-jared-kushner-and-albanias-fight-against-trumps-resorts.md) - Campaign against luxury developments in protected wetlands has become national revolt over land, corruption and power\n- [You will die at 30](https://www.opendemocracy.net/queer-elders-you-will-die-at-30.md) - This is the first episode of our new narrative non-fiction podcast, How to Find Queer Elders that follows the life-affirming journey of Awo Dufie, a 23 year-old trans woman from Ghana, in her quest to find queer elders at a time when LGBTQI lives across Africa are violently rendered invisible.\n- [Under